173
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:44,160
Upon following your desires.

174
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:46,140
Upon all this sinfulness.

175
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:48,240
Tamanna ala Allah.

176
00:18:48,860 --> 00:18:49,860
He is still waiting for Allah.

177
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:51,400
Allah, do good to me.

178
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:53,140
Allah, give me money.

179
00:18:53,300 --> 00:18:54,040
Upon shirk.

180
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:55,920
Upon sehir.

181
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:58,380
Upon going to churches as a Muslim.

182
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:00,980
