183
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:02,920
No, you have to stop that.

184
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:12,900
So al-Imam rahimahullah mentioned about 38 ahadith.

185
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:14,920
To make us understand that,

186
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:18,380
evil deeds are followed by evil repercussions.

187
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:23,300
And good deeds are followed by goodness.

188
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:25,320
If you are upon good deeds,

189
00:19:25,820 --> 00:19:27,500
if a person is upon sin,

190
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:31,720
he begins to anticipate khairat, barakat.

191
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:34,480
The day he starts tawbah.

192
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:36,480
He will feel it by himself.

193
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:39,740
I have turned a new leaf.

194
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:42,980
And I know somebody who was like that.

195
00:19:43,860 --> 00:19:44,820
He used to be on drugs.

196
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:46,060
He is late now.

197
00:19:46,780 --> 00:19:48,060
He used to be on drugs.

198
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:49,760
He used to have people.

199
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,980
He would be in bus stops, pickpockets.

200
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:52,800
All of this.

201
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:56,960
Their house is just about 5 or 6 houses away from us.

202
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:59,260
And his father was well known.

203
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:02,060
This boy just turned one day.

204
00:20:02,340 --> 00:20:03,280
He observed salah.

205
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,300
He went to the masjid.

206
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:05,840
The masjid where if he came,

207
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:08,340
everybody was afraid what he came to do.

208
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:11,520
He made wudu, two units of prayer.

209
00:20:11,940 --> 00:20:12,940
Just like that.

210
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:14,420
Just like that.

211
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,260
This boy turned.

212
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:19,120
Muhammad was his name.

213
00:20:19,460 --> 00:20:20,420
He turned.

214
00:20:21,100 --> 00:20:23,700
He began upon good deeds.

215
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:26,600
So that time, everybody who saw him,

216
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:26,920
they said,

217
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,440
We are looking calm now.

218
00:20:28,780 --> 00:20:30,040
We are looking honorable.

219
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,360
We are looking this.

220
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:33,940
One of the men in the masjid volunteered

221
00:20:34,700 --> 00:20:36,880
to provide him his daughter for marriage.

222
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:38,680
But you know what, ikhwa?

223
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,920
This man did not stay long till he died.

224
00:20:42,940 --> 00:20:44,540
Just like the prophet had told us,

225
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:46,080
alayhi salatu wa salam,

226
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:47,100
about the one,

227
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:51,320
Inna ahadakum la ya amalu bi amali ahali naar.

228
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:54,100
The individual will be upon the deeds

229
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:56,080
of the people of Jahannam.

230
00:20:56,080 --> 00:20:58,320
Hatta ma ya kunu bayna hu

231
00:20:58,320 --> 00:21:00,820
wa bayna ha illa zira'a

232
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:02,170
wa ya asbiqu alayhi al-kitab

233
00:21:03,020 --> 00:21:05,140
wa ya amalu bi amali ahali al-jannah.

234
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:06,120
But look at it.

235
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:08,230
The prophet, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam,

236
00:21:09,020 --> 00:21:10,540
when he told us in this hadith,

237
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:12,660
that individual has to do

238
00:21:12,660 --> 00:21:15,200
amalu ahali al-jannah before dukhul al-jannah.

239
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:18,100
You can't get al-jannah with amalu ahali naar.

240
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:20,000
This is what we are talking about.

241
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:22,780
You want al-jannah bi amali ahali al-jannah.

242
00:21:22,780 --> 00:21:26,120
You want Jahannam if you continue upon that.

243
00:21:26,420 --> 00:21:30,020
If you continue upon the deeds of ahali naar,

244
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,960
it does not lead to anywhere but naar.

245
00:21:33,300 --> 00:21:35,640
But as for the deeds of ahali al-jannah,

246
00:21:36,460 --> 00:21:38,540
the individual has to switch

247
00:21:38,540 --> 00:21:41,940
from the deeds of ahali naar

248
00:21:41,940 --> 00:21:44,180
to the deeds of ahali al-jannah.

249
00:21:44,500 --> 00:21:46,900
You do not get al-jannah

250
00:21:47,540 --> 00:21:50,660
being upon the deeds of ahali naar.

251
00:21:50,660 --> 00:21:53,420
May Allah protect all of us, depending on the sin

